OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch revive red versus
OL,4,Ablue politics as Reform land
OL,5,A'gobsmacking' donations
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham and Badenoch revive red versus
OL,8,Fblue politics as Reform land
OL,9,F'gobsmacking' donations
OL,11,FLook closely at the posters, placards
OL,12,Fand online posts. Your eyes aren't
OL,13,Fdeceiving you if Labour's red seems a
OL,14,Flittle deeper and the Conservatives'
OL,15,Fblue a little truer.
OL,17,FPolitics seems to have found a new
OL,18,Frhythm, one that feels a little
OL,19,Ffamiliar, despite Reform's jaw-dropping
OL,20,Fnew donations putting it back in the
OL,21,Fheadlines today.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
