OL,3,AFire at nursing home in Chile kills 16
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 16 elderly residents have died
OL,7,Fin a fire at a nursing home in Chile,
OL,8,Faccording to authorities.
OL,10,FTen others were evacuated after a blaze
OL,11,Fbroke out at El Eden home in
OL,12,F/idt2/d9cfcc9a-2842-463f-a4d8-4dd007ef9
OL,13,F547, around 640km (400 miles) south of
OL,14,Fthe capital Santiago, on Friday
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,17,FJorge Granada, a prosecutor leading the
OL,18,Fcase, said it was not clear at this
OL,19,Fstage what caused the incident.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
